('127.107.d.15.C',3,'In a one-point perspective of a room, the lines going away from the viewer meet at:','["Two points", "Three points", "No point", "One vanishing point"]'::jsonb,3,'One-point perspective.','original'),
('127.107.d.15.C',4,'A freehand one-point perspective is a quick way to show:','["A room''s depth", "Pricing", "Soil", "Wiring"]'::jsonb,0,'Depth from perspective.','original'),
('127.107.d.15.D',3,'A bill of materials with budgeting information lists items, quantities, and:','["Songs", "Costs", "Weather", "Jokes"]'::jsonb,1,'BOM includes costs.','original'),
('127.107.d.15.D',4,'A total cost is found by multiplying quantity by:','["Year", "Room size", "Unit price", "Item color"]'::jsonb,2,'Cost = qty x price.','original'),
('127.107.d.15.E',3,'Technology is used to create and modify interior drawings through:','["Levels", "Hammers", "Paint rollers", "CAD software"]'::jsonb,3,'CAD edits drawings.','original'),
('127.107.d.15.E',4,'Placing standard furniture blocks into a CAD plan:','["Saves time and keeps scale accurate", "Deletes layers", "Wastes time", "Distorts scale"]'::jsonb,0,'Blocks speed work.','original'),
('127.107.d.15.F',3,'Plotting an interior drawing for a presentation requires setting the:','["Furniture", "Scale and paper size", "Color of the walls", "Weather"]'::jsonb,1,'Plot settings.','original'),
('127.107.d.15.F',4,'Printing a floor plan at the wrong scale would make it:','["Perfect", "Colorful", "Impossible to measure accurately", "Smaller in cost"]'::jsonb,2,'Wrong scale ruins accuracy.','original'),
('127.107.d.16.A',3,'Illustrating ideas from direct observation might mean sketching:','["A schedule", "A song", "A random shape", "An actual room in a house"]'::jsonb,3,'Observation sources ideas.','original'),
('127.107.d.16.A',4,'Drawing from experience and imagination allows a designer to:','["Generate original interior concepts", "Skip drafts", "Avoid ideas", "Copy only"]'::jsonb,0,'Source of ideas.','original'),
('127.107.d.16.B',3,'Comparing contrast and harmony in two rooms is an exercise in studying:','["Weather", "Design elements and principles", "Taxes", "Safety rules"]'::jsonb,1,'Compare design.','original'),
('127.107.d.16.B',4,'A room using strong contrast between dark and light often feels:','["Dull only", "Empty", "Dramatic", "Quiet only"]'::jsonb,2,'Contrast adds drama.','original'),
('127.107.d.16.C',3,'Elaborating on a rough sketch means:','["Hiding it", "Shrinking it", "Erasing it", "Adding more detail and refinement"]'::jsonb,3,'Elaborate to refine.','original'),
('127.107.d.16.C',4,'A designer turns a quick thumbnail of a bedroom into a detailed rendering. This is:','["Elaborating a visual solution", "Estimating", "Copying", "Avoiding work"]'::jsonb,0,'Develop ideas.','original'),
('127.107.d.16.D',3,'A design for a practical application serves a real:','["Rumor", "Need or use", "Joke", "Fantasy"]'::jsonb,1,'Practical means useful.','original'),
('127.107.d.16.D',4,'Designing a small apartment''s storage solution is a:','["Poem", "Menu", "Practical design application", "Song"]'::jsonb,2,'Real-world problem.','original'),
('127.107.d.16.E',3,'Interior design media include markers, colored pencils, and:','["Hoses", "Carpentry saws", "Wrenches", "Digital rendering software"]'::jsonb,3,'Media for presentation.','original'),
('127.107.d.16.E',4,'Using markers to add color to a room perspective demonstrates:','["Effective use of design media", "Delay", "Error", "Clutter"]'::jsonb,0,'Media enhance drawings.','original'),
('127.107.d.17.A',3,'A personal resume should highlight education and:','["Opinions", "Work history", "Home address of friends", "Favorite food"]'::jsonb,1,'Highlight qualifications.','original'),
('127.107.d.17.A',4,'Choosing which experiences to list on a resume means selecting:','["All hobbies", "Blank space", "The ones most relevant to the job", "Random items"]'::jsonb,2,'Be selective.','original'),
('127.107.d.17.B',3,'A resume made using word processing technology is easy to:','["Break", "Lose", "Hide", "Edit and update"]'::jsonb,3,'Digital edits are easy.','original'),
('127.107.d.17.B',4,'A resume should be formatted in a clean layout so that it is:','["Easy to read", "Crowded", "Hard to read", "Colorful only"]'::jsonb,0,'Readability matters.','original'),
('127.107.d.17.C',3,'Before listing someone as a reference, you should:','["Guess", "Ask for permission", "Skip asking", "List a stranger"]'::jsonb,1,'Courtesy.','original'),
('127.107.d.17.C',4,'A good professional reference is someone who:','["Dislikes you", "Has not met you", "Knows your work and can speak well of it", "Is a stranger"]'::jsonb,2,'Choose knowledgeable references.','original'),
('127.107.d.17.D',3,'A letter of recommendation is written by someone who can:','["Find you a car", "Pay your bills", "Take your exams", "Vouch for your skills and character"]'::jsonb,3,'Recommendation supports you.','original'),
('127.107.d.17.D',4,'To obtain a good recommendation, you should give the writer:','["Plenty of notice and your resume", "Nothing", "No notice", "A gift only"]'::jsonb,0,'Help the writer.','original'),
('127.107.d.17.E',3,'A record of work experiences, licenses, and certifications is useful when:','["Sleeping", "Applying for jobs", "Traveling", "Cooking"]'::jsonb,1,'Keep records.','original'),
('127.107.d.17.E',4,'Keeping copies of certificates and updating the record regularly helps you to:','["Lose papers", "Hide skills", "Show qualifications quickly", "Delay hiring"]'::jsonb,2,'Maintain records.','original'),
('127.107.d.18.A',3,'The first step in solving an interior design problem is to:','["Pick a color", "Start painting", "Buy furniture", "Identify the problem"]'::jsonb,3,'Define first.','original'),
('127.107.d.18.A',4,'A client says a living room feels cramped. The designer should first:','["Analyze the layout and traffic", "Ignore it", "Paint it", "Add more furniture"]'::jsonb,0,'Analyze before acting.','original'),
('127.107.d.18.B',3,'Breaking a hotel lobby design into zones such as seating and reception helps the designer to:','["Avoid planning", "Analyze each area separately", "Skip areas", "Remove zones"]'::jsonb,1,'Decompose.','original'),
('127.107.d.18.B',4,'After analyzing each part of a problem, the designer should:','["Start over", "Discard them", "Combine the solutions into one design", "Ignore them"]'::jsonb,2,'Reassemble.','original'),
('127.107.d.18.C',3,'Measuring a window twice before ordering blinds shows:','["Luck", "Speed", "Carelessness", "Accuracy and precision"]'::jsonb,3,'Double check.','original'),
('127.107.d.18.C',4,'A precise furniture plan is drawn to scale so that the pieces:','["Fit the room as drawn", "Are guesses", "Look random", "Cannot be moved"]'::jsonb,0,'Scale ensures fit.','original'),
('127.107.d.18.D',3,'A student who completes a room plan alone is:','["Cheating", "Working independently", "Avoiding work", "Working in a team"]'::jsonb,1,'Independence.','original'),
('127.107.d.18.D',4,'To work independently on a design project, you should:','["Wait", "Ask for each step", "Set milestones and follow them", "Skip planning"]'::jsonb,2,'Self-management.','original'),
('127.107.d.18.E',3,'Two students dividing work on a model home are:','["Working alone", "Competing", "Arguing", "Working collaboratively"]'::jsonb,3,'Collaboration.','original'),
('127.107.d.18.E',4,'Effective collaboration requires team members to:','["Communicate and respect each other''s ideas", "Withhold ideas", "Compete secretly", "Ignore teammates"]'::jsonb,0,'Teamwork skill.','original'),
('127.107.d.18.F',3,'Researching an interior design project for a clinic includes:','["Picking songs", "Reviewing the users'' needs and codes", "Naming rooms", "Reading comics"]'::jsonb,1,'Research informs design.','original'),
('127.107.d.18.F',4,'Studying existing spaces similar to the project is called:','["Procrastination", "Final plotting", "Precedent research", "Billing"]'::jsonb,2,'Look at precedents.','original'),
('127.107.d.18.G',3,'An effective interior design product solves the client''s problem and is:','["Late", "Unfinished", "Hidden", "Well presented"]'::jsonb,3,'Presentation matters.','original'),
('127.107.d.18.G',4,'A presentation board commonly includes a floor plan, a color palette, and:','["Material samples", "Receipts", "Passwords", "Bills"]'::jsonb,0,'Boards show materials.','original'),
('127.107.d.18.H',3,'Presenting a final design for critique shows how well the student:','["Copied", "Met the project criteria", "Avoided work", "Guessed"]'::jsonb,1,'Critique assesses.','original'),
('127.107.d.18.H',4,'A useful way to respond to critique of a design is to:','["Ignore it", "Argue each point", "Take notes and refine the design", "Stop working"]'::jsonb,2,'Use feedback.','original'),
('127.109.d.1.A',3,'A safe working practice on a construction site is to:','["Ignore signs", "Run on site", "Skip PPE", "Wear required personal protective equipment"]'::jsonb,3,'PPE is required.','original'),
('127.109.d.1.A',4,'Before climbing a ladder to run conduit, an electrician should:','["Inspect the ladder", "Lean it on a pipe", "Ignore it", "Use a damaged one"]'::jsonb,0,'Inspect first.','original')
